<title>USA: National Computer Systems wins contract.</title>
<headline>National Computer Systems wins contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Computer Systems Inc said Monday Reader's Digest Association (Canada) Limited renewed a multi-year contract for data collection services.</p>
<p>The contract requires the processing of Reader's Digest subscriptions, promotional products and sweepstakes entries.</p>
<p>The value of the contract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>National Computer Systems provides software, services and systems for the collection, management and interpretation of data.</p>
<p>Shares of National Computer Systems were trading off 1/2 to 26-1/4.</p>
<p>		     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
